1245
01:33:37.363 --> 01:33:38.603
Listen, Raunak.

1246
01:33:38.723 --> 01:33:40.278
We know where the witch is.

1247
01:33:41.414 --> 01:33:42.917
Get to Mukteshwar temple.

1248
01:33:43.739 --> 01:33:45.148
We put an end to this today.

1249
